0 Samebeat — near conjugate pivot, inverted pendulum
0 Name: samebeat.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/samebeat.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 One unchanged compound pendulum; choose a different stock suspension hole.
0 Only the motorized support moves by command. The pendulum is always passive.
0 Ordinary stock parts. No authored welds, fixed base, extra joints or solver overrides.
