0 Assembly stage 3: carrier
0 !BW ID input_axle
0 4L input axle spansZ−110..−30 and seats through output socket and keyed crank beam
1 0 0 0 -70 0 1 0 0 0 1 1 0 0 3705.dat
0 !BW ID input_key
0 3L keyed beam transfers motor torque to support crank
1 1 0 0 -60 -1 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 7229.dat
0 !BW ID support_crank
0 7L support crank: O=h2 atY0 and P=h4 atY40;16mm support radius
1 1 0 20 -80 -1 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 32524.dat
0 !BW ID input_key_pin_-20
0 2L friction pin joins input key and crank
1 0 0 -20 -70 0 1 0 0 0 1 1 0 0 2780.dat
0 !BW ID key_shared_pin_20
0 One3L pin owns the input key, crank and output key at their sharedY20 hole
1 1 0 20 -80 0 1 0 0 0 1 1 0 0 6558.dat
0 !BW ID input_retainer
0 Half bush retains input axle at front of crank
1 72 0 0 -95 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 4265c.dat
0 !BW ID pivot_key
0 Keyed3L beam holds support axle rigidly on the crank
1 1 0 40 -100 -1 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 7229.dat
0 !BW ID pivot_key_pin_60
0 2L friction pin joins support axle key and crank
1 0 0 60 -90 0 1 0 0 0 1 1 0 0 2780.dat
